            <!--/resource/1724752057000/emailtemplateimage -->
            <p>
                Dear {!relatedTo.Primary_Contact_Title__c} {!relatedTo.PrimaryContact__r.Name},
            </p>
            <p>
                We are excited to inform you about some of the key next steps for your home in Nawayef West. Our team has been working in the background to prepare the home interior colour palettes for you and your family to make your selection from, as well as other administrative items.
            </p>
            <p>
                We understand the importance of these major milestones and would like to invite you to visit our sales and experience centre to confirm your colour scheme and complete other key administrative steps. Please advise a time that best suits your schedule for the appointment, where we will assist you through the process to enable us to issue your SPA.
            </p>
            <p>
                To prepare for your visit, below are the steps we will take you through on the day.
            </p>
            <ol>
                <li>Confirm your selection of the colour scheme for finishes within the interior of your home.</li>
                <li>Arrange payment of Abu Dhabi Municipality Fees by providing a cheque for the 2% Abu Dhabi Municipality Fees plus ADM admin fees, total amount due <apex:outputText value="{0, number, ###,##0.00}" styleClass="slds-text-heading_small"> <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.ADM_Fees_Dari_charges__c}" /> </apex:outputText> or by initiating a bank transfer for the fees using the details outlined below. Please provide a transaction receipt as proof of the transfer and include your unit number as the reference.<br/><br/><br/>
                    <table>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>Account number:</b></td> 
                            <td  >4031005972963002</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>IBAN Number:</b></td> 
                            <td  >AE610354031005972963002</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>Currency:</b></td> 
                            <td  >AED</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>Customer name: </b></td> 
                            <td  >HUDAYRIYAT DEVELOPMENT LLC – ADM</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>Customer address: </b></td> 
                            <td  >Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>Bank name: </b></td> 
                            <td  >First Abu Dhabi Bank</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>Swift Code:</b></td> 
                            <td  >NBADAEAA</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td  ><b>Reference:</b></td> 
                            <td  >{!relatedTo.Unit__r.Name}</td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </li>
                <li>Submit the six post-dated cheques for the payments due from September 2024, as per the project payment plans, outlined in the documents attached.</li>
            </ol>
            <p>
                Once the above steps are complete, your SPA will be issued, after which your property will be registered with the Abu Dhabi Municipality.
            </p>
            <p>
                As a token of our appreciation for putting your trust in Modon, we have arranged a small gift to be presented to you at our sales and experience centre.
            </p>
            <p>
                We very much look forward to welcoming you, so please do let us know the best time that suits your schedule.
            </p>
            <p>
                As always if you have any questions or need further assistance, please do not hesitate to contact us on 800 MODON (66366).
            </p>
        </body>
    </html>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>